Description: Open-source remote desktop application with Wayland and hardware codec support
 RustDesk is a full-featured open-source remote desktop client and server.
 This package is built specifically for Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (amd64) with
 native Wayland screen capture (PipeWire, XDG portals, DRM/KMS via
 libdrmtap, and keyboard shortcuts inhibit) as well as hardware-accelerated
 video encoding and decoding via VA-API, VDPAU, NVENC, and FFmpeg 8.
